        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYou are assigned multiple targets.\r\rHelen West, now found to be the Serial Killer of Colorado Springs &apos;87. She poisons her victims with lethal doses of ricin. Reported to have killed around 15 people.\r\rJanus, former Communist Officer. He was brutal in his prime during the soviet era. Believed to have killed 278 innocent civilians\r\rSusan Wilson, expert thief and assassin. A contract has been put on her head by a former botched victim looking for revenge.\r\rGood hunting, 47.",
